<word key="gdbills_acp_seed_title" js="0"><![CDATA[Seed Existing Laws]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_seed_intro" js="0"><![CDATA[Imports the bundled list of well-known existing state firearms laws (Illinois Protect Illinois Communities Act, NY SAFE Act, etc.) as bill_type=law. No API calls. Safe to re-run; existing rows update in place.]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_seed_button" js="0"><![CDATA[Seed existing laws]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_seed_done" js="0"><![CDATA[Existing laws seeded: {1} upserted of {2} processed.]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_detect_title" js="0"><![CDATA[Detect Prior-Session Laws]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_detect_intro" js="0"><![CDATA[Queries LegiScan for enacted firearms bills (status=Passed) from prior years (2021-2024) and tags them as existing laws. Admin-triggered only; not part of the daily sync.]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_detect_warning" js="0"><![CDATA[This uses significant LegiScan API quota. Limit by state to control usage.]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_detect_state_label" js="0"><![CDATA[State]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_detect_all_states" js="0"><![CDATA[All 50 states (heavy quota)]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_detect_button" js="0"><![CDATA[Detect prior-session laws]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_detect_done" js="0"><![CDATA[Prior-session detection complete: {1} tagged as existing law of {2} processed.]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_reparse_title" js="0"><![CDATA[Re-parse Stored Bills]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_reparse_intro" js="0"><![CDATA[Recompute progress / status from data already stored in the database — no LegiScan API calls. Fixes stage stalls (e.g. bills stuck at the wrong tracker step) after a parser improvement, without spending sync quota. Advance-only: a became_law / vetoed / failed terminal state is never downgraded.]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_reparse_button" js="0"><![CDATA[Re-parse stored bills]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_reparse_done" js="0"><![CDATA[Re-parse complete: {1} bills updated of {2} processed.]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_refetch_title" js="0"><![CDATA[Re-fetch Official Links]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_refetch_intro" js="0"><![CDATA[Backfills the official state bill link (state_link) + full history for existing bills that don't have them yet. Uses ~1 LegiScan API call per bill — far cheaper than a full keyword sync. State + batch limits cap quota; the WHERE filter (state_link IS NULL OR history IS NULL) makes it resumable, so re-running picks up where it left off. After it runs, those rows link to the official state page AND become fully offline re-parseable.]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_refetch_button" js="0"><![CDATA[Re-fetch official links]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_refetch_batch_label" js="0"><![CDATA[Batch size]]></word>
<word key="gdbills_acp_refetch_done" js="0"><![CDATA[Re-fetch complete: {1} bills updated of {2} processed.]]></word>
